""
"// Handle 'up' exit status (open vs closed)

exit = door(room,up);

if (exit) {

  if ( is_open( exit ) )

    act_tochar( #open, ch );

  else

    act_tochar( #closed, ch );

}

"
E
"open"
"Layered in dust, this narrow, vertical mine shaft hasn't seen the light of day

in quite some time.  Cut of rough-hewn limestone, the chiseled walls of the

shaft are braced by sturdy granite beams arranged in a truss formation. Evenly

spaced, coarse iron rungs form a ladder leading down, delving deeper into the

heart of the mountain. The opening above leads out of the mine shaft to a small

dark dave.

"
E
"closed"
"Layered in dust, this narrow, vertical mine shaft hasn't seen the light of day

in quite some time.  Cut of rough-hewn limestone, the chiseled walls of the

shaft are braced by sturdy granite beams arranged in a truss formation. Evenly

spaced, coarse iron rungs form a ladder leading down, delving deeper into the

heart of the mountain.  The way up is blocked by several sturdy planks of wood,

nailed down from the outside.

"
!
